[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025733\">7015A04</a></p><p>1. Working from inside the tailgate, undo the badge fixing nut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048917.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Remove the badge (1a) from the outside of the tailgate, releasing\nthe centering pins (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048918.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the crest  is undamaged.</p><p>Place the badge in position, attaching\nthe centering pins.</p><p>Tighten the badge fixing nut.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025733\">7015A04</a></p>"]]